# Input

```svelte
{#if a}<!-- after if -->
	<i>x</i>
{:else}<!-- after else -->
	<i>y</i>
{/if}
{#each items as item}<!-- after each -->
	<i>{item}</i>
{/each}

```


# Formatted

```svelte
{#if a}
	<!-- after if -->
	<i>x</i>
{:else}
	<!-- after else -->
	<i>y</i>
{/if}
{#each items as item}
	<!-- after each -->
	<i>{item}</i>
{/each}

```
